posts.text:
We talk a lot about getting boys off their screens; we also need to build better real-world alternatives.  As
@RichardVReeves puts it: "The best antidote to a bad man online is a good man in the flesh, in the lives of our boys..." 
ofboysandmen.substack.com/p/…

